      "dropdownContentHtml": "<p><span>A container initially contains </span><span data-no-break=\"true\"><span><em>n</em> <span>gallons</span></span></span><span> of water. A student adds <span data-no-break=\"true\">15 gallons</span> of water, making the container 60% full. After the student adds 10 more gallons of water, the container is 80% full.</span></p><p><span>Select the correct answers from <span>each</span> drop-down to complete the sentences.</span></p><div><p><span>Let <em>x</em> represent the total number of gallons the container can hold.&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span>The equation that represents the situation immediately after the student adds <span data-no-break=\"true\">15 gallons</span> of water is </span><span>\\(n+15=\\)</span> <span data-no-break=\"true\">&nbsp;<span>\n<span data-dropdown-width=\"150\">{{dropdown-1}}</span>\n</span><span>.</span></span></p> <p><span>The equation that represents the situation after the student adds <span data-no-break=\"true\">10 gallons</span> of water is </span><span data-no-break=\"true\"><span>\\(n+25=\\)</span> &nbsp;<span>\n<span data-dropdown-width=\"150\">{{dropdown-2}}</span>\n</span><span>.</span></span></p> <p><span>The number of gallons, <em>n</em> , in the container initially is </span><span>\n<span data-dropdown-width=\"150\">{{dropdown-3}}</span>\n</span><span> gallons.</span></p></div>",
      "dropdownContent": [
        "A container initially contains n gallons of water. A student adds 15 gallons of water, making the container 60% full. After the student adds 10 more gallons of water, the container is 80% full.\nSelect the correct answers from each drop-down to complete the sentences.\nLet x represent the total number of gallons the container can hold.\nThe equation that represents the situation immediately after the student adds 15 gallons of water is \\(n+15=\\)\n{{dropdown-1}}\n.\nThe equation that represents the situation after the student adds 10 gallons of water is \\(n+25=\\)\n{{dropdown-2}}\n.\nThe number of gallons, n , in the container initially is\n{{dropdown-3}}\ngallons."
